    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bfd4514bb387eafa879f592",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王和丸善斯基一起并跑练习。\n丸善斯基是别名“超跑”的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4018a205deba372a38839027dfd5144a30e93a7845c20846895c53904330839b",
