    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb7264d93fe084b7467457f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌会这么担心也很正常。\n目白阿尔丹的身体不好，\n经常进出医院。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87deb16dad988785b8a02c186873410e879e14ede80ba6e79d69122b9c9c5d93",
